# viewport 844x390@3
# A phone held sideways: the title, then Hosted Play's shared-screen 2P (player 2 on A / D, W), the HUD's slim
# side rails, a serve by each player, pause, settings over the pause menu, and leaving.
until 300 Paddle Pulse
frames 30
save title
touch =All modes
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
touch =Hosted Play
until 60 Shared-screen 2P
frames 10
touch =Shared-screen 2P
until 400 =GO
frames 90
key Space 3
hold KeyA
frames 30
release KeyA
frames 60
save play
key Escape 2
until 60 Restart match
frames 10
touch =Settings
until 60 Accessibility
frames 10
save settings
touch =Done
until 60 Restart match
frames 10
save pause
touch =Leave match
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
